<br>- Merchant Sali Vaah has restocked her inventory with merchandise appropriate for her location.
<br>- Marius and Lady Darkblade have become more wary of adventurers. They may be seen less often within their area of influence.

<P>*** Quests ***

<P>- Brandus Levine's fourth and fifth quests will now award armor wearable at level 15 rather than level 24.
<br>- Nethet will now award the Blackshield medallion instead of trying to give two bracelets.
<br>- Several quests in Everfrost will no longer give food as a reward.

<P>*** Tradeskills ***

<P>- Player-crafted poisons will now proc twice as many times as they did previously.
<br>- The recipes for Halberds, Imbued Short Bows, and Imbued Clubs will now all work properly.

<P>*** Optional Voiceover ***

<P>- Another 25MB of optional Combat voiceover is now available for download.
<br>- To enable optional downloads, run EverQuest II and click "Download Options" on the launchpad. Select the optional audio packs you would like to download and click the "Save Changes" button.
<br>- Note: This download is part of the 400+ MB optional voiceover update offered on February 16. If you previously downloaded the following files, you already have this optional voiceover data:

<P>OP3englishVoiceOver17.vpk
<br>OP3englishVoiceOver18.vpk
<br>OP3englishVoiceOver19.vpk
<br>OP3englishVoiceOver20.vpk
