<P>One thing that I would like to clarify about "adventure packs" is that they are NOT expansions.   With EverQuest 2 you will see three levels of major content added on a regular basis.  This will be monthly content updates through the patch process, than twice a year you will see adventure packs like today, and every year or more you will see an expansion that you will have to purchase at the store.  Some of these are free, some are not :).

<P>So click on <b>Comments...</b> below to begin discussing the adventure pack and what you've discovered about it so far!
